			"Message": "build(deps): bump effect from 3.21.1 to 3.21.2\n\nBumps [effect](https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect/tree/HEAD/packages/effect) from 3.21.1 to 3.21.2.\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect/blob/main/packages/effect/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/Effect-TS/effect/commits/effect@3.21.2/packages/effect)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: effect\n  dependency-version: 3.21.2\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  update-type: version-update:semver-patch\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>",
